  "description": "Reinstatement of two self-contained residential units into a single dwellinghouse, together with the erection of a full-width lower ground floor rear extension replacing the existing rear extension and stair; and a part-width rear extension at raised ground floor level with replacement terrace; replacement of all Rear Elevation windows from aluminium framed double glazed to timber framed double glazed; York stone to front drive, front steps, risers and coping stones replacing existing material; pv panels to side flat roof; rooflight to main roof at rear; rooflights to flat roof sections to side; car charging point to front drive. ",
